aria2 is bundled as resources/aria2/aria2c.exe and started by the app itself. It
is a separate program, unmodified, run as a child process over its documented
JSON-RPC interface; none of its code is linked into this project.

  aria2
    Copyright (C) 2006, 2019 Tatsuhiro Tsujikawa
    Source: https://github.com/aria2/aria2 (release-1.37.0)
    License: GNU General Public License version 2 or later. The full text ships
    next to the binary as resources/aria2/COPYING, and the author list as
    resources/aria2/AUTHORS.

Because aria2 is GPL-2.0-or-later and this project is AGPL-3.0-or-later, this
project's own code is covered by the AGPL and the bundled aria2 binary by the
GPL. Distributing this repository, or anything built from it, means shipping
resources/aria2/COPYING together with the binary.

